OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FAlexandra Humphreys introduces an
OL,7,     Fafternoon of great music-making,
OL,8,     Fincluding highlights from the
OL,9,     FEdinburgh International Festival
OL,10,     Fand orchestral music from the
OL,11,     FEuropean Lowlands.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Schubert
OL,13,     F5/5. Kate Molleson journeys
OL,14,     Fthrough the last five years of
OL,15,     FFranz Schubert's life. Today,
OL,16,     Ffocusing on his final year, when
OL,17,     FSchubert composed some of his most
OL,18,     Ficonic chamber music.
