OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FPierre-Laurent Aimard plays live.
OL,7,     FMusic historian Kate Williams on
OL,8,     Fpresenting upcoming episodes of
OL,9,     FRadio 3's Key Changes.
OL,10,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,11,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,12,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,13,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,14,     FMacMillan, Handel and Rachmaninov.
OL,15,G1930 Friday Night is Music Night
OL,16,     FSaxophonist Amy Dickson joins
OL,17,     Fconductor Owain Park and the BBC
OL,18,     FConcert Orchestra at The Anvil in
OL,19,     FBasingstoke for a concert of music
OL,20,     Fconnected to the stars and
OL,21,     Fheavens.
