OL,5,G2145 The Essay: In Voice
OL,6,     FTenor Nicky Spence celebrates
OL,7,     Fgreat voices and the power of
OL,8,     Funforgettable singing, exploring
OL,9,     Fwhat makes a voice distinctive.
OL,10,G2200 Late Junction
OL,11,     FVerity Sharp picks adventurous
OL,12,     Fmusic inspired by agricultural
OL,13,     Fcycles and their rituals, with
OL,14,     Ftracks from Mary Stark, Sordure
OL,15,     Fand Matmos.
OL,16,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,17,     FSoweto is joined live in session
OL,18,     Fby legendary American saxophonist
OL,19,     FGary Bartz and British band Your
OL,20,     FBrother's Keeper, performing music
OL,21,     Ffrom their new album 'Where Rivers
OL,22,     FMeet'.
